  "idea": "A compact, modern two-storey house with flat roofs behind parapets. The walls are white render downstairs and white vertical cladding upstairs, with a stone pier at the entry and a dark panel garage door. A double garage sits against the blank east party wall. The front door opens to a foyer with the home office beside it and a U-shaped stair behind. A hallway passes the powder room and laundry to the open-plan kitchen, meals and family room across the back, which opens to a covered alfresco facing the river garden. A butler's pantry links the kitchen and the garage. Upstairs, a rumpus room faces the street. The rear bedroom suite has a double walk-in robe and ensuite, and there are three more bedrooms, a bathroom, a powder room and a linen walk-in. A covered deck off Bedroom 4 sits on the garage roof. A 2.8 m garden strip runs down the west side. The DNN land holds only the boundary walls and planting.",
