  "review_note": "The house is fitted to the 13.5 m frontage at its brochure width of 10.4 m. That leaves a 2.8 m garden strip on the west, and the garage sits 0.3 m off the east party wall. The rear wall is at y 16.2 m, so the alfresco (4.3 × 2.8 m) stays inside the ONT band, ending at 19.0 m against the 19.73 m limit. Nothing is built on the DNN land except the boundary walls. The garage door is set 3.9 m behind the 3.0 m front wall, which is enough for the gate leaves and a short apron, but not to park in front of the garage. The plan is adapted from a commercial volume-builder design for study only. Building it would need the design owner's licence or a new design."
